{"unit_id":"stone100010__dsh-token-gauge#feature-1","repo":"stone100010/dsh-token-gauge","commit":"74887c54e8954512124145447ab59157333b19b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Token Gauge 的功能「会话 token 总量」：汇总当前会话的输入与输出 token，并在左侧仪表显示总量及输入细节。切换当前会话后读取对应投影。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:457-505","lib/client.js:970-982"]}
{"unit_id":"stone100010__dsh-token-gauge#feature-2","repo":"stone100010/dsh-token-gauge","commit":"74887c54e8954512124145447ab59157333b19b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Token Gauge 的功能「生成速度」：每秒采样输出 token 增量并换算 tok/s；没有新的输出时，改用会话记录的平均解码速度。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:539-569","lib/client.js:987-993"]}
{"unit_id":"stone100010__dsh-token-gauge#feature-3","repo":"stone100010/dsh-token-gauge","commit":"74887c54e8954512124145447ab59157333b19b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Token Gauge 的功能「费用估算」：按输入、缓存读写和输出 token 的内置参考单价计算美元估值，并在右侧仪表与预算刻度展示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:72-85","lib/client.js:324-331","lib/client.js:996-1000"]}
{"unit_id":"stone100010__dsh-token-gauge#feature-4","repo":"stone100010/dsh-token-gauge","commit":"74887c54e8954512124145447ab59157333b19b0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Token Gauge 的功能「可调整浮层」：拖动标题移动面板、拖拽角落调整宽高、点击按钮折叠；浏览器会记住这些状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:223-281","lib/client.js:893-920"]}
{"unit_id":"stone100010__dsh-token-gauge#caveat-1","repo":"stone100010/dsh-token-gauge","commit":"74887c54e8954512124145447ab59157333b19b0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Token Gauge 的费用数字按代码内的参考单价估算，并非网关账单；若实际模型价格不同，估值也会偏差。参考价格和预算刻度定义在 lib/client.js。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:72-85","lib/client.js:324-331"]}
